{"id":50382,"date":"2026-04-01T20:29:48","date_gmt":"2026-04-01T19:29:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/scalabis-night-race\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:07:51","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:07:51","slug":"scalabis-night-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/scalabis-night-race\/","title":{"rendered":"Scalabis Night Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Santar\u00e9m recebe a <strong>Scalabis Night Race 2026<\/strong> a 18 de abril, iluminando o centro hist\u00f3rico com uma energia contagiante. Os atletas que garantirem as suas <strong>inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Scalabis Night Race<\/strong> participar\u00e3o na <strong>corrida Scalabis 2026<\/strong>, um evento que funde desporto e cultura sob o luar ribatejano.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udccb <strong>Dados T\u00e9cnicos:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li><strong>Nome:<\/strong> Scalabis Night Race<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Data:<\/strong> 18 de Abril de 2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Local:<\/strong> Santar\u00e9m (Partida no Jardim da Liberdade)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Terreno\/Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> Pavimento Urbano (asfalto e cal\u00e7ada). Prova de 10 km e Caminhada de 5 km.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Diferenciador:<\/strong> Percurso noturno com passagens por monumentos nacionais iluminados e pelo interior da antiga Escola Pr\u00e1tica de Cavalaria. Destaca-se pelos postos de anima\u00e7\u00e3o com ranchos folcl\u00f3ricos e o ic\u00f3nico abastecimento com vinho tinto e petiscos regionais.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Sobre o Local:<\/strong> Situada nas varandas sobre o Tejo, Santar\u00e9m \u00e9 a capital do g\u00f3tico em Portugal. Para a recupera\u00e7\u00e3o energ\u00e9tica, sugere-se a <strong>Sopa da Pedra<\/strong> ou as <strong>Enguias fritas<\/strong>, terminando com o tradicional doce <strong>Pampilho<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":40383,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,672,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[39,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50382","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-santarem","event_type-corrida","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/475387718_942085644723301_277840471656162548_n-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50382","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50382"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50382\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61757,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50382\/revisions\/61757"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/40383"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=50382"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-js